(7702340, 1264426, 67258, '<td valign="top">Really interesting to see that you took this with a drone!  I bought a mini last year, but literally the week I bought it, my area was moved into a no-fly zone, so I haven''t been able to practice.  Its been really interesting to see how graveyards are around the world.  This one resembles many of the British rural graveyards, although the wooden church is a give-away.  One thing that does differ is that following a couple of horrific accidents involving small children, all unstable stones are either fixed, or laid down.  Having a wander and look around grave yards is something of a British past time, and in rural communities its not unusual to have the sheep in to ''mow'' the grass.<br/></td>', 'Really interesting to see that you took this with a drone!  I bought a mini last year, but literally the week I bought it, my area was moved into a no-fly zone, so I haven''t been able to practice.  Its been really interesting to see how graveyards are around the world.  This one resembles many of the British rural graveyards, although the wooden church is a give-away.  One thing that does differ is that following a couple of horrific accidents involving small children, all unstable stones are either fixed, or laid down.  Having a wander and look around grave yards is something of a British past time, and in rural communities its not unusual to have the sheep in to ''mow'' the grass.', '2021-10-01 09:58:16.000000', NULL, 0),
