(7702524, 1264417, 115664, '<td valign="top">I read a book once about searching for the Holy Grail, it mentioned a church in France with a strange tower and an inscription "Abandon All Hope all Ye Who Enter Here''............I found it very fascinating! Is this the church??? Beautiful image.</td>', 'I read a book once about searching for the Holy Grail, it mentioned a church in France with a strange tower and an inscription "Abandon All Hope all Ye Who Enter Here''............I found it very fascinating! Is this the church??? Beautiful image.', '2021-10-04 18:22:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7702766, 1264417, 123833, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JayneRyan:</b></div><hr/><i> I read a book once about searching for the Holy Grail, it mentioned a church in France with a strange tower and an inscription "Abandon All Hope all Ye Who Enter Here''............I found it very fascinating! Is this the church??? Beautiful image. </i></td></tr></table> The priest who chose the inscription in the French church must have been a joker ;) The quote is from Dante Alighieri''s Divine Comedy.</td>', 'Originally posted by JayneRyan: I read a book once about searching for the Holy Grail, it mentioned a church in France with a strange tower and an inscription "Abandon All Hope all Ye Who Enter Here''............I found it very fascinating! Is this the church??? Beautiful image.  The priest who chose the inscription in the French church must have been a joker ;) The quote is from Dante Alighieri''s Divine Comedy.', '2021-10-07 04:17:29.000000', NULL, 0);
